{'symbol': 'POOL', 'date': '2022-05-04 17:38:00', 'title': 'POOL CORPORATION ANNOUNCES AN INCREASE IN ITS SHARE REPURCHASE PROGRAM TO A TOTAL AUTHORIZATION OF $600 MILLION, A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND INCREASE AND 2022 ANNUAL MEETING OF STOCKHOLDERS VOTING RESULTS', 'text': "COVINGTON, LA., MAY 04, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- POOL CORPORATION (NASDAQ/GSM:POOL) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS (THE BOARD) HAS AUTHORIZED AN ADDITIONAL $196.2\xa0MILLION UNDER ITS EXISTING SHARE REPURCHASE PROGRAM FOR THE PURCHASE OF THE COMPANY'S COMMON STOCK IN THE OPEN MARKET AT PREVAILING MARKET PRICES. THIS AMOUNT ADDS TO THE $403.8\xa0MILLION REMAINING UNDER ITS EXISTING AUTHORIZATION AS OF MAY\xa03, 2022, BRINGING ITS TOTAL AUTHORIZATION AVAILABLE TO $600.0\xa0MILLION."}